## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npm test` inside `benchmarks/` to ensure all existing unit tests pass.
- Run `npx ts-node benchmarks/scripts/testApiConnectivity.ts` to verify API key validity and connectivity.
- Verify dataset generation script execution: `npx ts-node benchmarks/scripts/generate500Dataset.ts`.

### Manual Verification
1. Inspect `benchmarks/dataset/manifest.json` to confirm no documents have category `EDGE_CASE` unless explicitly designed as edge cases.
2. Confirm OpenRouter PNG conversion works on sample PDF.
3. Monitor live log execution during full benchmark run to verify rate-limit compliance and 0 unhandled failures.
